    <string name="setup_merge_instructions"><b>To merge from the widget</b> (optional): the Merge button on tasks waiting for review merges Claude\'s PR from this phone. Edit the token and, for each project repo:\n\n1. Repository access: add the project repo (for example Taskboard-widget)\n2. Permissions → Repository: <b>Contents: Read and write</b>, <b>Pull requests: Read and write</b>, and <b>Actions: Read-only</b> (to see that CI passed)\n\n<b>This gives the phone write access to those repos\' code</b>: anyone with the token could push to them. Skip it if you only want to read the board and approve tasks.</string>
